  "description": "MailerSend .NET API Client (Unofficial) -\n            This is an unofficial .NET implementation of the MailerSend API. This project provides a convenient way to interact with MailerSend's services from .NET applications.\n            \n            Disclaimer -\n            This project is NOT officially associated with, authorized, maintained, sponsored, or endorsed by MailerSend or any of its affiliates or subsidiaries. This is an independent and unofficial API implementation.\n\n            The MailerSend name and any related marks are trademarks of MailerSend.\n\n            This is a work in progress -\n            This is not, by any means, a finished product. If you download, you must have in mind. You can modify, fix, and complete any way you want, but I will be working on this on my spare time.\n\n            You can work around the unfinished stuff, which is mostly bug fixing and responses.",
